left\\|\\overrightarrow{AC}-\\overrightarrow{AB}\\right\\|^2=AC^2+2\\,\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}+AB^2$\n```","variables":[],"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"0"}],"correction":{"steps":["$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2-2\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}+\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$, comme $(a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2$.","Ici : $BC^2=AC^2-\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{2\\,\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}}+AB^2$.","Et $\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=AC\\times AB\\times\\cos\\widehat{BAC}$ : on obtient la formule d'Al-Kashi."]}},{"statement":"Soit $ABC$ un triangle. On veut démontrer la formule d'Al-Kashi :\n\n$$BC^2=AB^2+AC^2-2\\times AB\\times AC\\times\\cos\\widehat{BAC}$$\n\nD'après la relation de Chasles, $\\overrightarrow{BC}=\\overrightarrow{BA}+\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\overrightarrow{AC}-\\overrightarrow{AB}$, donc $BC^2=\\left\\|\\overrightarrow{AC}-\\overrightarrow{AB}\\right\\|^2$.\n\nEn développant, $BC^2=AC^2-2\\,\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}+AB^2$. On prend $AB={{eval:c}}$, $AC={{eval:b}}$ et $\\widehat{BAC}=60^\\circ$, avec $\\cos 60^\\circ=\\dfrac{1}{2}$. Complète.\n\n$BC^2=?$","variables":[{"name":"b","expression":"2..9"},{"name":"c","expression":"2..9"}],"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:b^2+c^2-b*c}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}={{eval:b}}\\times{{eval:c}}\\times\\dfrac{1}{2}={{eval:b*c/2}}$.","Donc $BC^2={{eval:b^2}}-2\\times{{eval:b*c/2}}+{{eval:c^2}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:b^2+c^2-b*c}}}$."]}},{"statement":"Soit $ABC$ un triangle. On démontre la formule d'Al-Kashi : $BC^2=AB^2+AC^2-2\\times AB\\times AC\\times\\cos\\widehat{BAC}$.\n\nRemets les étapes de la démonstration dans l'ordre.\n\n```ranger\nsigne: aucun\n- Par la relation de Chasles, $\\overrightarrow{BC}=\\overrightarrow{BA}+\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\overrightarrow{AC}-\\overrightarrow{AB}$.\n- Donc $BC^2=\\left\\|\\overrightarrow{AC}-\\overrightarrow{AB}\\right\\|^2$.\n- En développant, $BC^2=AC^2-2\\,\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}+AB^2$.\n- Comme $\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=AC\\times AB\\times\\cos\\widehat{BAC}$, $BC^2=AB^2+AC^2-2\\times AB\\times AC\\times\\cos\\widehat{BAC}$.\n```","variables":[],"correction":{"steps":["On écrit $\\overrightarrow{BC}$ avec $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ et $\\overrightarrow{AC}$, puis on développe son carré scalaire, comme $(a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2$.","Le produit scalaire s'écrit avec le cosinus de l'angle : on obtient $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\text{la formule d'Al-Kashi}}$."]}}],"shared":{},"test_specs":[{"description":"AC − AB","variationIndex":0,"variables":{},"answers":["0"],"expected":{"status":"correct"}},{"description":"Erreur : AB − AC","variationIndex":0,"variables":{},"answers":["1"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Erreur : AB + AC","variationIndex":0,"variables":{},"answers":["2"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Erreur : AC + CB","variationIndex":0,"variables":{},"answers":["3"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"AC² − 2AC·AB + AB²","variationIndex":1,"variables":{},"answers":["0"],"expected":{"status":"correct"}},{"description":"Erreur : AC² − AB²","variationIndex":1,"variables":{},"answers":["1"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Erreur : AC² + AB²","variationIndex":1,"variables":{},"answers":["2"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Erreur : avec + 2AC·AB","variationIndex":1,"variables":{},"answers":["3"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"19 (25 + 9 − 15)","variationIndex":2,"variables":{"b":"5","c":"3"},"answers":["19"],"expected":{"status":"correct"}},{"description":"Erreur : 34 (sans le produit scalaire)","variationIndex":2,"variables":{"b":"5","c":"3"},"answers":["34"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Erreur : 4 (25 + 9 − 30, cosinus oublié)","variationIndex":2,"variables":{"b":"5","c":"3"},"answers":["4"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Erreur : 49 (signe +)","variationIndex":2,"variables":{"b":"5","c":"3"},"answers":["49"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Erreur : √19 (BC au lieu de BC²)","variationIndex":2,"variables":{"b":"5","c":"3"},"answers":["\\sqrt{19}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}},{"description":"Étapes dans l’ordre","variationIndex":3,"variables":{},"answers":["3","0","1","2"],"expected":{"status":"correct"}},{"description":"Erreur : deuxième et troisième étapes échangées","variationIndex":3,"variables":{},"answers":["3","1","0","2"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"}}]}$qdeme$::jsonb,
